<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	    O/N =  8.52%				    O/N = 7.67%</p>
<p>	    T/N =  7.68%				    T/N = 5.12%</p>
<p>Oct 4, 1996 Oct 3, 1996</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  7.72%	1 month forward =  6.14%</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  6.97%	2 month forward =  6.21%</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  7.52%	3 month forward =  6.95%</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  8.28%	4 month forward =  7.71%</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  8.60%	5 month forward =  8.03%</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  8.75%	6 month forward =  8.25%</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
</text>
